      "source": "eventfd and signalfd",
      "source_hash": 590200717296776343,
      "context_hash": 2547031522644580922,
      "translation": "eventfd와 signalfd",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "eventfd": "eventfd"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:37.920419Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Event notification and signal delivery through file descriptors",
      "source_hash": 7127105355702719026,
      "context_hash": 13277497994512418902,
      "translation": "파일 디스크립터를 통한 이벤트 통지와 시그널 전달",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "file descriptors": "파일 디스크립터"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:37.920420Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "eventfd: a counter you can poll",
      "source_hash": 3888029832642694465,
      "context_hash": 4175740178789500242,
      "translation": "eventfd: poll할 수 있는 카운터",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "eventfd": "eventfd"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:37.920421Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "`eventfd` creates a file descriptor backed by a kernel counter.",
      "source_hash": 14116494456498056568,
      "context_hash": 2112369624712471775,
      "translation": "`eventfd`는 커널 카운터를 기반으로 하는 파일 디스크립터를 생성합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "file descriptor": "파일 디스크립터",
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:37.920422Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "It's used for:",
      "source_hash": 15008548910390372652,
      "context_hash": 11671249203092783173,
      "translation": "다음과 같은 용도로 사용됩니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:37.920422Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Event notification between threads or processes",
      "source_hash": 11026344353014341201,
      "context_hash": 14366197315875701473,
      "translation": "스레드 또는 프로세스 간 이벤트 통지",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "processes": "프로세스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:37.920422Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Waking up `epoll`/`select`/`poll` from another context",
      "source_hash": 8022457605696869806,
      "context_hash": 2592075433225609950,
      "translation": "다른 컨텍스트에서 `epoll`/`select`/`poll` 깨우기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:37.920423Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Counting occurrences (semaphore-like, but pollable)",
      "source_hash": 6222097332168023769,
      "context_hash": 9404227728264335680,
      "translation": "발생 횟수 세기(세마포어와 비슷하지만 poll 가능)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "semaphore": "세마포어"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:37.920423Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "Writing (signaling)",
      "source_hash": 3486555497990146141,
      "context_hash": 5294458049600919623,
      "translation": "쓰기(시그널링)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:37.920423Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "Writing an 8-byte `uint64_t` adds to the counter:",
      "source_hash": 18062153167745601554,
      "context_hash": 10924138007516519779,
      "translation": "8바이트 `uint64_t`를 쓰면 카운터에 더해집니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "byte": "바이트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:37.920423Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "Reading (consuming)",
      "source_hash": 3061167094833583633,
      "context_hash": 14381109110673489767,
      "translation": "읽기(소비)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:37.920423Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "Reading an 8-byte `uint64_t` returns the current counter and resets it to 0:",
      "source_hash": 1014135664089931548,
      "context_hash": 8393965402452844887,
      "translation": "8바이트 `uint64_t`를 읽으면 현재 카운터 값을 반환하고 카운터를 0으로 초기화합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "byte": "바이트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:37.920424Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:12/seg:0",
      "source": "EFD_SEMAPHORE mode",
      "source_hash": 16434723844744190391,
      "context_hash": 17960457744702101975,
      "translation": "EFD_SEMAPHORE 모드",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:37.920424Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:13/seg:0",
      "source": "With `EFD_SEMAPHORE`, each `read()` decrements by 1 and returns 1 (not the full count):",
      "source_hash": 796525415438523052,
      "context_hash": 1762928943398332891,
      "translation": "`EFD_SEMAPHORE`를 사용하면 각 `read()`는 카운터를 1씩 감소시키고 (전체 카운트가 아닌) 1을 반환합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:37.920425Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:15/seg:0",
      "source": "epoll integration",
      "source_hash": 11256472082288159470,
      "context_hash": 149013741424495852,
      "translation": "epoll 통합",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "epoll": "epoll"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:37.920425Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:16/seg:0",
      "source": "The key feature: `eventfd` integrates with `epoll` so you can wake a sleeping event loop:",
      "source_hash": 10451671324959375033,
      "context_hash": 10360966692690679905,
      "translation": "핵심 기능: `eventfd`는 `epoll`과 통합되므로 잠들어 있는 이벤트 루프를 깨울 수 있습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:37.920425Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:18/seg:0",
      "source": "Typical uses",
      "source_hash": 9135500904841723184,
      "context_hash": 13384563750304318161,
      "translation": "일반적인 용도",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:37.920425Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:19/seg:0",
      "source": "**Thread pool wakeup**: Instead of a mutex+condvar, use eventfd with a work queue:",
      "source_hash": 11518575158576600582,
      "context_hash": 7208373814368439765,
      "translation": "**스레드 풀 깨우기**: 뮤텍스+condvar 대신 작업 큐와 함께 eventfd를 사용합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "eventfd": "eventfd",
        "mutex": "뮤텍스",
        "pool": "풀",
        "queue": "큐"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:37.920426Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:21/seg:0",
      "source": "**io_uring completion notification**: io_uring can post to an eventfd when completions arrive:",
      "source_hash": 12531225176645927760,
      "context_hash": 13201182402368692263,
      "translation": "**io_uring 완료 통지**: io_uring은 완료가 도착하면 eventfd에 통지를 게시할 수 있습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "eventfd": "eventfd"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:37.920426Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:23/seg:0",
      "source": "Kernel implementation",
      "source_hash": 289839300155434675,
      "context_hash": 13098095930273463143,
      "translation": "커널 구현",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:37.920426Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "signalfd: receive signals via file descriptor",
      "source_hash": 18235379439728461458,
      "context_hash": 16278221158536650053,
      "translation": "signalfd: 파일 디스크립터로 시그널 수신",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "file descriptor": "파일 디스크립터"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:37.920426Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Normally, signals interrupt the current execution at unpredictable points. `signalfd` delivers signals as readable data on a file descriptor, making signal handling compatible with `epoll`-driven event loops.",
      "source_hash": 12782495084905335580,
      "context_hash": 11783984144586835231,
      "translation": "일반적으로 시그널은 예측할 수 없는 시점에 현재 실행을 인터럽트합니다. `signalfd`는 시그널을 파일 디스크립터에서 읽을 수 있는 데이터로 전달하므로, 시그널 처리를 `epoll` 기반 이벤트 루프와 호환되게 만듭니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "file descriptor": "파일 디스크립터",
        "interrupt": "인터럽트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:37.920427Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "signalfd_siginfo fields",
      "source_hash": 73792902443452426,
      "context_hash": 13174168742519524158,
      "translation": "signalfd_siginfo 필드",
